### Identity Server API

### Authorization Code Flow (User to App)

# 1. Get Discovery Document
GET https://localhost:5001/.well-known/openid-configuration
Accept: application/json

###

# 2. Authorization Request
GET https://localhost:5001/connect/authorize?
    client_id=payment-webapp&
    response_type=code&
    redirect_uri=https://localhost:5001/signin-oidc&
    scope=openid profile email payment_api offline_access&
    state=12345&
    code_challenge=XYZ&
    code_challenge_method=S256

###

# 3. Token Request (Authorization Code)
POST https://localhost:5001/connect/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=authorization_code&
code=AUTHORIZATION_CODE&
redirect_uri=https://localhost:5001/signin-oidc&
client_id=payment-webapp&
code_verifier=XYZ

###

# 4. Refresh Token Request
POST https://localhost:5001/connect/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=refresh_token&
refresh_token=REFRESH_TOKEN&
client_id=payment-webapp&
client_secret=K7gNUu4qZBWf0qVvMY8z2Dj8Qx9kXFjG2vCHZNFj2E8

###

### Client Credentials Flow (App to App)

# Payment Processing Service Token Request
POST https://localhost:5001/connect/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=client_credentials&
client_id=payment-processing-service&
client_secret=S5gNUu4qZBWf0qVvMY8z2Dj8Qx9kXFjG2vCHZNFj2E5&
scope=payment_api risk_assessment_api

###

# Bank Adapter Service Token Request
POST https://localhost:5001/connect/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=client_credentials&
client_id=bank-adapter-service&
client_secret=L2gNUu4qZBWf0qVvMY8z2Dj8Qx9kXFjG2vCHZNFj2E3&
scope=bank_adapter_api

###

### User Info

# Get User Info
GET https://localhost:5001/connect/userinfo
Authorization: Bearer ACCESS_TOKEN
Accept: application/json

###

# Get User Claims
GET https://localhost:5001/connect/userinfo/claims
Authorization: Bearer ACCESS_TOKEN
Accept: application/json

###

### Health Checks

# Health Check
GET https://localhost:5001/health
Accept: application/json

###

# Readiness Check
GET https://localhost:5001/health/ready
Accept: application/json

###

# Liveness Check
GET https://localhost:5001/health/live
Accept: application/json

###

### Root Endpoint
GET https://localhost:5001/
Accept: application/json
